OL,3,GNEWSACalls to check trees ahead of
OL,4,Astorm season
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to check their
OL,7,Ftrees for damage ahead of autumn and
OL,8,Fwinter storms after thousands came down
OL,9,Fduring Storm Goretti in January.
OL,11,FIn September, the Met Office warned
OL,12,Fwetter and warmer-than-normal weather
OL,13,Fcould be on the way this autumn, driven
OL,14,Fby a strengthening El Nino.
OL,16,FAndy McCutcheon, technical officer for
OL,17,FGuernsey Trees for Life, said: "It's
OL,18,Fincumbent upon all tree owners to take
OL,19,Fthe opportunity now before the main
OL,20,Fstorm season, to take a look at signs
OL,21,Fof problems."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
